    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n'20 Sliabh Amharc', is an elegant, stylish & modern four bedroomed (main ensuite) (approx. 127 sq. mts) semi detached home, superbly located in a small exclusive cul-de-sac area within this fine development, commending lovely views & all within walking distance of Enniscorthy town with an array of shops, restaurants, cafes, excellent amenities, schools, and public transport to hand. \n\nThis cleverly designed home is in excellent condition & with meticulous standards on display. The new owners will be delighted with the light & space this home offers. It comprises an entrance hallway, kitchen/dining with a quality fitted kitchen, utility room dining area, sunroom & sitting room The first floor consists of four bedrooms, one of which has an en-suite & a family bathroom. The attic is floored and offers additional storage. The home captures a wonderful sense of space & light both inside & out, the gardens are private with patio area & boasting a detached block shed.\n\nThere is an excellent balance of well-proportioned & tastefully detailed rooms, in which quality features throughout. is guaranteed to appeal particularly to families seeking a home of quality in a quiet, mature setting in a nice neighbourhood. The location is second-to-none & only minutes' walk to local schools & the town centre.\nView and be impressed!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance - 2.0m x 5.6m\nWith tiled flooring and carpet to stairs.\n\nLiving Room - 4.0m x 5.7m\nSpacious room wwith wooden flooring, feature fire with stove inset, double doors to\n\nDining Area - 4.6m x 4.5m\nNice area with tiling to floor.\n\nKitchen - 2.9m x 2.6m\nLight filled room with a good array of quality fitted kitchen units. offering great storage, Oven, hob & extracor fan included. Tilig to floor.\n\nSun Room - 2.9m x 2.5m\nLight filled room with door to rear garden.\n\nUtility - 1.5m x 2.0m\nWith built-in presses, plumbed for washing machine and dryer.\n\nW.C. - 1.5m x 1.6m\nWill wc & wbh, fully tiled room.\n\nLanding - 3.0m x 3.7m\n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.3m x 4.5m\nDouble room with fitted wall to all wardrobes with vaniy unit, door to\n\nEn-suite - 2.2m x 1.4m\nModern & stylish room with shower, wc & whb with vanity unit, lovely classic tiling.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.1m x 3.9m\nDouble room with wooden flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.7m x 2.7m\nLovely size room with wooden flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.3m x 2.8m\nLovely size room with wooden flooring.\n\nMain Bath - 1.7m x 1.8m\nBeautifully tiled room with bath, wc and whb.\n\nBlock garden Shed - \nIdeal for home office or working from home, with electic and water connected.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Spacious four bed (main ensuites) family home of approx. 127.2 sq mts.</li><li>Exclusive location at end of cul de sac, within walking distance of Enniscorthy town centre, minutes drive to M11. </li><li>Walk in Condition with a modern & stylish finish. </li><li>Private gardens & excellent parking.</li><li>Detached block garden shed ideal for working from home.</li><li> Floored attic offering additional storage.</li><li></li><li>Services:</li><li>Mains water and sewage, high speed broadband available in the area.</li><li>Included in the sale:</li><li>Curtains, carpets, blinds, oven, hob & extractor fan.</ul>"
      },
